* The administrator's AI choice page (S.69 step 2, plan .claude/plan-ai-step2.md and plan-fullscreen-toolkit.md A2b; owner, 23 Oct 2026: "an ai choice page. The connection
* information for each ai should be filled in except for the key and the model which the user needs to provide. There should be a checkbox for the currently selected
* provider. ... a fourth option for a user selected model where the user has to fill everything in. The same model needs to be used by all accounts. There needs to be an
* API gate for each user account").  An administrator app.
